							</div>
						</a>

						<a href="/areas-related-to-circles/applications-and-practice" class="next-lesson">
							<div>
								<small>NEXT LESSON</small>
								<strong>Applications & Practice</strong>
							</div>
							<span>→</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</article>

				<!-- SIDEBAR -->
				<aside class="lesson-sidebar">
					<div class="sidebar-card">
						<div class="sidebar-title">AREAS RELATED TO CIRCLES</div>
						<div class="progress-text">Lesson 02 of 04</div>
